    "mapping": "network_world_adapter.py run-resolved (NETWORK_RESOLVED): one population per membrane patch and network channel, Kv1p5 -> kv1p5_mh@1, KLeak -> kleak_always_open@1, max_permeability = max Dm / tm, abundance 1, permeant K (1.0); availability 1 (0 in INIT for 'init active: false'); gates (m_inf, h_inf)(0 V) in INIT and (m_inf, h_inf)(Cells' INIT-end patch Vm) at the SIM handoff (BETSE re-reads the network at SIM start: an initial condition of the experiment)"
  },
